message: "If you use this model, cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CPU-GPU Pipeline Scheduling Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A seed-controlled discrete-event model of CPU-side task selection in a
  four-stage CPU/GPU pipeline, comparing FIFO, static submit-priority and
  GPU-queue-feedback dispatch under four synthetic workloads. Numerical
  model only: no hardware, driver or kernel measurements.
type: software
authors:
